                <pb facs="0197" n="91" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg91"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12, 1891</hi>.</date>
                        (Received January 14.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>On night of 6th instant six ships of Chilean navy, at instance of congressional
                    majority, revolted and still lie inactive off shore; are now declared outlawed.
                    Large number of opposition leaders on board. Army seems solid for President. The
                    Government so far maintains perfect order throughout country.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
